| Discovery           | System Information Discovery       |
| Collection          | Data from Information Repositories |
| Reconnaissance      | Gather Victim Identity Information |

> **Note:** This challenge primarily focuses on **mobile forensic investigation** rather than analysing an active cyber attack. The MITRE mapping above reflects the types of artifacts examined rather than attacker behaviour.

